          },
          "name": "get_review_case_flow",
          "description": "Open one case from the reviewer's team queue: request, status, traveller (first name + surname initial), the traveller's statement, the AI-prepared agent_brief (unverified), requested amount, max_approvable, the reviewer's own approval limit, facts from Meridian's records (the baggage claim, the disruption and its compensation band, or the assistance codes) and the decision options. Another team's case or an unknown id returns NOT_FOUND.",
          "schemas": {
