    {
      "id": "flow:get_my_cases_flow",
      "data": {
        "name": "get_my_cases_flow",
        "description": "List the verified traveller&#39;s open and past cases with the assigned team, status (OPEN, APPROVED, REJECTED), requested amount, reply-by date and - once a person has decided - the approved amount and the message from the team (customer_message). Use it when the traveller asks about the status of a request.",
