    {
      "id": "flow:record_baggage_claim_flow",
      "data": {
        "name": "record_baggage_claim_flow",
        "description": "Record a delayed, lost, damaged or pilfered bag for a flight on the verified traveller&#39;s booking that has arrived. Pass the flight, the traveller&#39;s own description, the interim expenses they ask for (dollars, or empty) and baggage_claim_agent&#39;s full answer exactly as returned. The system validates the agent&#39;s claim type, bag-type and colour codes, contents and missing report fields against Meridian&#39;s tables (a bag is LOST only 5+ days after arrival), records the claim and opens a Baggage Services case. Returns RECORDED with claim_id, case_id, team, reply-by date, the missing report fields and what to send, ALREADY_RECORDED, or NOT_RECORDED with reason_code SESSION_INVALID, NOT_FOUND, NOT_ARRIVED, DESCRIPTION_MISSING or CLAIM_TYPE_UNKNOWN. Interim expenses are decided by a person.",
