    {
      "id": "flow:request_assistance_flow",
      "data": {
        "name": "request_assistance_flow",
        "description": "Add special assistance to an upcoming flight on the verified traveller&#39;s booking. Pass the flight, the traveller&#39;s needs in their own words and special_assistance_agent&#39;s full answer exactly as returned. The system validates the agent&#39;s IATA SSR codes (only codes a traveller can request, one wheelchair code, a medical need adds MEDA), adds them to the traveller&#39;s own segment as PENDING_CONFIRMATION and opens an Accessibility Desk case. Returns REQUESTED with request_id, the codes and status, medical_clearance, case_id, team and reply-by date, ALREADY_REQUESTED, or NOT_RECORDED with reason_code SESSION_INVALID, NOT_FOUND, NOT_UPCOMING, NEEDS_MISSING or NO_VALID_CODES. A person on the Accessibility Desk confirms it.",
